":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"Arch WSL, Officalなそれなんでしたっけ","ts":"1617025044.162500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wQhGI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"768bb233-d5c6-46eb-9fd7-19eaf7a756ca","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Arch を入れるのは私には無理だったのでおとなしく Ubuntu を使おう","ts":"1617024362.162100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O92qO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b9fe916-0bf2-436e-8a76-fc4f4a6892d5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ArchWSL を入れようとしたのだけど、インストールした後にどうすればいいかまったくわからずに死亡した。たぶん WSL 自体に対する知識が足りていない気がする…","ts":"1617023617.161700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dHA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ea5fd6f-b8ac-49e4-9474-f6df0a3e14bb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあ AutoHotkey 向けに書いた秘伝の設定ファイルがあるので、乗り換える場合は移行コストがそれなりにかかるわけなんだけど… :totemoturai:","ts":"1617023248.160900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qu40"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de58cd12-7320-4386-802a-5e552fad3af2","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"RPAの出番？","ts":"1617022984.160200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OYs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80f35c5e-5487-48da-896d-5bea7bd364c4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"keyhac はそもそもキー入力だけか。全般的な自動化に使いたいのでダメだった","ts":"1617022617.159900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"74/i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e074abdd-e3ae-454e-b756-389e5a6a49bf","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"keyhac は以前調べた時は乗り換えるに至らなかった記憶があるけど何が問題だったかはあまりちゃんと覚えてない…とりあえず Python なのはあまり個人的には印象よくない (独自よりかはマシだけど)\n改めて調べてみるか","ts":"1617021136.159400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks"